window.products.push({"id":818201,"name":"Laguna Beach Hand-Painted Souvenir Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41F5pT6Y1GL._AC_.jpg","description":"This exquisite hand-painted, collector's edition ornament depicts Laguna Beach, located in the heart of Orange County, California. Laguna Beach is known for its spectacular ocean views, sandy beaches, canyons and coastal bluffs. The best known landmark on Main Beach in Laguna is the old white lifeguard tower. Hand-crafted design: The Laguna Beach ornament is only 2.8 inches tall, approximately the size of a real egg, and painstakingly hand-painted by artisans in St. Petersburg, Russia, known worldwide for its miniature artworks and Faberg? eggs. Artisans do NOT use stencils, imprints, or ready photos. Only the painters' hands, brushes and paints are used to create these truly unique designs. Technique: Only traditional methods are used in creating these unique pieces. The construction of these ornaments begins with whole, natural timber, the same lightweight wood used for Russian nesting dolls. By using lightweight wood instead of glass, these ornaments are shatterproof. The wood is first cut carefully into its egg shape and then sanded to smooth the edges. Then, the artist paints the design directly onto the ornament surface in layers, allowing each layer to dry before painting the next layer. Finally, the ornament is lacquered three times by hand with varnish specifically formulated to avoid cracks, reactions and deterioration over time. Display: Hang it on a Christmas tree or Easter tree. The flat bottom of the Laguna Beach ornament also allows it to stand on a flat surface such as a table, shelf, or curio cabinet for year-round display. This Laguna Beach ornament makes a wonderful souvenir of your visit to Laguna Beach and one that will be cherished for generations to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41F5pT6Y1GL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sterling Pear","source_asin":"B002T8FVZ0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002T8FVZ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002T8FVZ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":818202,"name":"Coaster Glass Top Console Table Chrome 720339","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m7W3hqhYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Extend a glamorous motif throughout an entryway with the charming radiance from this chrome sofa table. Elongated in silhouette, the rectangular glass top is great for adding an open and airy feel. The bright and reflective shine of metallic bliss gives this modern piece its chic personality. Delicately curved, the hourglass-inspired silhouette of the legs welcomes a feminine French-inspired feel. Add structure with the built-in storage shelf featuring mirrored details.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m7W3hqhYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coaster Home Furnishings","source_asin":"B01MRVBT08","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRVBT08","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRVBT08","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
