window.products.push({"id":818232,"name":"XERAN Foldable Storage Bags | Heavy-Duty Large Organizer Bags for Clothing, Bedding, Blankets, Household Garments | for Easy Storage Under Bed or as C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LWiRDk28L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organize your closets and maximize your storage space. Use XERAN storage bags to neatly pack away bulky duvets; comforters; sweaters; jackets and coats; extra clothing, etc. Our fabric storage bags come flat-packed, two per package, ready for you to unfold when they’re needed to store out-of-season or extra clothing and bedding. This feature makes our storage bags amazingly versatile as they take up very little space when not in use. Also, no measuring is required as they can easily fit into tight spaces such as under the bed or on a shelf, something that’s impossible to do with hard plastic storage bins. Plus, we think our fabric storage bags look far more stylish in a closet by revealing just enough through the stitched-in clear window to show what’s stored inside. INCLUDED: 2 bags measuring 19.7”x15.8”x9.8” – 50x40x25cm. Made of 600D waterproof polyester fabric in an attractive blue; clear window; smooth dual-way zippers and dependable, reinforced handles. PROTECT YOUR ITEMS. Protect seasonal items and keep them safe from dust, bed bugs, moisture and mildew. VERSATILE. Generous in size, each bag provides ample space for clothing; extra pillows; duvets and comforters; quilts and blankets; towels; seasonal wardrobes; bedding and linens; knitting and crochet supplies; sewing supplies. CREATE ORDER. Easily shelve them up high in a closet or under the bed, the trunk of your car, your dorm, in the garage, basement, attic, cellar, laundry or storage room. STURDY CARRY HANDLES. Reinforced carry handles make lifting and carrying easy and convenient during transport or when retrieving from underneath the bed or a shelf. EASE OF USE. Fully unzip the bag and lay it down fully opened on a flat surface and start packing. Smooth-running, dual-way zippers make storing your items a breeze. Organize with style and ease. Do it with XERAN storage bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LWiRDk28L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XERAN Storage Solutions","source_asin":"B07H8M5LBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H8M5LBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H8M5LBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
