window.products.push({"id":818250,"name":"DALSTRONG 6 Piece Premium Kitchen Cookware Set - The Oberon Series - 3-Ply Aluminum Core - Pots and Pans Set - Silver - Cooking Set - w/Lid & Pot Prot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bV+0XDQ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A 9\" Frying Pan, 12\" Saute Pan, and 5 Quart Pot come together with perfect-fit tempered glass lids to create this compact, robust little set of Dalstrong Oberon Series cookware. Everything you need for fry-ups, sauces, pastas, and soups. 3-PLY ALUMINUM CORE & 18/10 STAINLESS STEEL CLADDING — for optimized heat conductivity, control, and responsiveness. Excel at searing, with cookware that gets hot fast. Layers of smudge-free aluminum & 18/10 stainless steel above and below the Aluminum Forged Foundation provide maximum durability and easy maintenance. These layers protect the incredible temperature control and speed of the copper core with durability and longevity. TRUE HEAVY GAUGE COOKWARE WITH VENTED LID — Ultra strong 2.5mm thickness that will never dent or warp under prolonged heat, for consistent cooking results every time. Heavy gauge cookware is strong, durable, and cooks food evenly. The bottom stays perfectly flat for even heat distribution. Strong, stainless steel lids will last a lifetime and maintain a perfect seal. The vented hole releases pressure to prevent rattling and food from boiling over. ERGONOMIC HANDLES AND FLARED LIP— All of the handles in Oberon pots, pans, and skillets are ergonomic. Designed to accommodate a professional chef's underhand grip, the perfectly angled handles ensure a comfortable and secure hold while cooking. Never drop or spill a dish again, thanks to handles that are easy to grip even while wearing oven mitts. Engraved side handles add even more control, while a flared lip creates the perfect drip-free pour, for easier serving of sauces and stir fries. LIFETIME WARRANTY against defects. Rocksolid 100% SATISFACTION OR MONEY BACK GUARANTEE, try it risk free, with renowned Dalstrong customer service. Over one million orders have been fulfilled so far. Compatible with all stovetops, oven and broiler safe up to 800 degrees F, freezer, dishwasher, and refrigerator safe. Oberon cookware is made from non-toxic, hypoallergenic materials that are PFOA and PTFE free, and the stainless steel surface is ultra-durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bV+0XDQ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalstrong","source_asin":"B08BZW13M6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BZW13M6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BZW13M6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
