window.products.push({"id":818357,"name":"PB010035 Thermostat Bake or Griddle Viking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UNNDZMedL._AC_.jpg","description":"PB010035 Griddle or Left Oven Thermostat--No Broil Griddle thermostat with no broil function. Used on all griddles and all ranges that have no broil function.Griddle or Left Oven THERMOSTAT. The oven thermostat maintains the correct oven Temperatures in the bake operations. In bake operation, thermostat contacts close completing. The bake circuit is through the bake ignitor, the bake gas Valve and to neutral. The thermostat contacts can be checked for continuity By using a continuity tester or an ohmmeter set to the Low ohms range. Power to the oven must be turned off And the thermostat wiring removed when checking the Contacts for continuity. Access to the thermostat Contacts can be made by removing the control panel. Replace the thermostat if the switch contacts are Defective.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UNNDZMedL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Culinary","source_asin":"B015B45QIU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015B45QIU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015B45QIU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":818358,"name":"AUBEINSON Gold Wall Decor， Real Metal Minimalist Wall Art，Round Gold Metal Wall Art Decor for Bedroom Living Room Home Indoor Office Wall Decor (Combi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bqoBALhDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Gold Round Wall Art Size：4 Pieces Big 9.65inch - 3 Pieces Small 5.9inch. 7 Pieces Gold Discs Decoration Set：You can be used on living room, bedroom, hallway, lounge and office walls, it is the perfect wall hanging for modern home or office decor. Easy to Install: Lightweight and easy to install, each piece of gold metal wall art has a small hanging hole on the back for easy hanging on the wall. High-Quality Metal Wall Art Decoration: The metal wall art decoration is made of iron material, which is not easy to bend or deform, with exquisite workmanship and durability. It withstands wear and damage, is suitable for indoor use, and is a good choice for decorating walls. Quality Commitment: If you have any problem receiving gold wall decor or you are not satisfied with our metal wall decor, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bqoBALhDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUBEINSON","source_asin":"B09V4WPJ3R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V4WPJ3R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V4WPJ3R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":818359,"name":"Bright Home Silicone Baking Mat - Food Safe, Non-Stick Sheet Mat for Baking - BPA free 11-5/8 x 16-1/2 -Half Sheet Size - Baked in America Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m7FL7f0-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brighthome’s non-stick silicone baking mat is a perfect addition to any kitchen! Whether it's baking chocolate chip cookies, cinnamon buns, or homemade bread, or roasting healthy vegetables or a choice piece of meat, this silicone baking mat will be your baking or roasting favorite!   Made of premium, non-stick, food grade silicone, it provides consistent heat distribution with all types of cooking or baking. It can be easily used in all types of ovens (except direct fire ovens) and it is heat resistant up to 450 degrees F.   With it’s flexible and durable design, it can be re-used countless times. With it’s convenient size (11.6 X 16.5 inches), it will easily fit half sheet baking pans.   Clean up is a breeze! When finished with baking or roasting, simply wash the mat by hand with soap and water and allow to air dry, or place the mat in the dishwasher (top rack only).   With it’s unique patriotic design and attractive gift sized box, this Brighthome silicone baking mat makes a perfect gift for the home baker or chef who has everything!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m7FL7f0-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brighthome","source_asin":"B08CXW7W94","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CXW7W94","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CXW7W94","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
