window.products.push({"id":818387,"name":"Top Selling Bed Sheets-4 Piece Set-Queen Bed Sheets Set-100% Cotton Sheets for Queen Size Bed Sheets Fits Upto 16 Inches Deep Pocket-Luxury Bedding Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IWmtvV-HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♥ 100% Cotton Bed Sheet Set ♥ Made In India ♥ Queen Size Luxury 4Pc Bed Sheets Set Include:- 1 Fitted sheet 60 x 80 Inch fits mattresses 15-18 inches deep, 1 flat sheet sheet 90 x 102 Inch and 2 Standard pillowcases 20 x 30-Inch. Deep pocket fitted sheet with elastic all around (not just the corners, like other sheets). ♥ HIGH QUALITY LIVING: Slip into Luxury, exceptionally smooth and soft to the touch, the Opulence 400 Thread Count sheet sets feature Extra-long staple cotton allowing you to relax into its cool comfort. ♥ ULTRA-SOFT COTTON SHEETS WITH LUSTROUS SATEEN WEAVE - Give into the look and feel of hotel-like bed sheets and smooth pillowcases with our sheet set. Made of 100% natural and sustainable long-staple cotton with 400 threads per inch, and lustrous sateen weave, the premium cotton sheet sets are densely woven to be long-lasting, ultra-soft, and authentic, unlike cheap microfiber sheets with a lower thread count which look worn out and tear easily after few washes. ♥ Extensive product checks and regular company audits ensure that the industry has a globally sustainable awareness of the responsible use of chemicals. The fabric is then tested for meeting performance like no pilling, shrinkage, colorfastness, tear strength, and thread count authenticity before being individually measured and stitched to perfection. Then it is inspected, piece by piece, to be defect free and packed as a set. ♥ OEKO-TEX MANUFACTURING: Woven, Processed, and Stitched in-house at our own dedicated vertically integrated manufacturing facility. This facility is CERTIFIED STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX: an independent certification system for textiles that tests products for harmful substances. ♥ 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - Our products are backed by incredible customer service to make sure your satisfaction is guaranteed. If for any reason you don't love our bedsheets, you can return them within 30 days for a full refund as per Amazon guidelines. Our high-quality designs match any decor and make the ultimate gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. Best for any room in your house - bedroom, guest, kids room, vacation home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IWmtvV-HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"aashirainwear","source_asin":"B0731CL95Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0731CL95Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0731CL95Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
