window.products.push({"id":818392,"name":"Stupell Industries Abstract Guitar Watercolor Pattern Painting Canvas Wall Art, 24 x 30, Design by Artist Annie Warren","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u3wEd6ngL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Proudly made in the USA, our stretched canvas is created with only the highest standards. We print with high quality inks and canvas, and then hand cut and stretch it over a 1. 5 inch thick wooden frame. The art comes ready to hang with no installation required. Not to mention, at this size, it is sure to be the focal point of any room!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u3wEd6ngL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stupell Industries","source_asin":"B0839WYCNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0839WYCNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0839WYCNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
