window.products.push({"id":818396,"name":"P PURLOVE Twin Over Twin Metal Bunk Bed,Twin Size Convertible Bunk Beds with Full Length Guardrail and Ladder Can Divided into Two Individual Platform","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HJG2gxXSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Twin Over Twin Bunk Bed】Twin size bunk beds features 2 twin size platform bed for efficiently accommodating two person, allowing you the freedom and space to host friends and also offering a sleeping solution.Convertible bunk bed twin size can be divided into 2 single twin size bed depending on your needs .Weight Capacity:220 lbs for upper bed, 220 lbs for lower bed. 【Metal Bunk Bed】This metal bunk bed is crafted from high quality sturdy steel structure features solid slats support and heavy-duty strength.Bunk bed Features a stunning chrome silver powder coated finish formulated for wear-resistance to protect the surface sheen from wear and tear. 【 Bunk Bed for Kids' Safety】This twin size metal bunk bed is designed with safety in mind.The upper bed features 12.7\" high safety guardrails to prevent you from falling.That will allow you to sleep safely and sleep tight over the night.Built in 2 step ladder is easy to get in and get out of upper bed 【Twin Size Bunk Bed】Twin over twin bunk bed overall dimension:77.5\"L x 41.4\"W x 61.6\"H,Recommended Mattress Thickness:Upper bed: 6\",Bottom bed: 8\",(Mattress not included)Weight Capacity:Upper bed: 250LBS,Bottom bed: 350LBS. 【Assemble and Delivery】Easy assemble is required for this bunk bed for kids, teens,with tools and clear instruction included,1 package delivery, any problem please feel free to contact us, we will solve the problem ASAP","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HJG2gxXSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P PURLOVE","source_asin":"B0BP7R81JP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP7R81JP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP7R81JP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":818397,"name":"Nobranded Moka Pot Stovetop Stainless Steel Espresso Coffee Machine Italian Cafe Maker with 100 Pieces Paper Filters Suitable for Stove (6 Cup,Fullbod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zfto8jcPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is the advantage of this stovetop espresso maker? Safety valve, the role of the safety valve, when the internal pressure of the moka pot is too high, or the resistance of the coffee powder is too large, release excess pressure to ensure the taste and safety of coffee Safety valve, the role of the safety valve, when the internal pressure of the moka pot is too high, or the resistance of the coffee powder is too large, release excess pressure to ensure the taste and safety of coffee Option:  2 Cup(100ml),  4 Cup(200ml),  6 Cup(300ml),9 Cup(450ml),  12 Cup(600ml), Option:  2 Cup(100ml),  4 Cup(200ml),  6 Cup(300ml),9 Cup(450ml),  12 Cup(600ml), Suitable for: Fire and induction cookers, electric furnace, ceramic furnace, alcohol furnace, gas stove. Suitable for: Fire and induction cookers, electric furnace, ceramic furnace, alcohol furnace, gas stove. Bonus: 100 pieces of coffee filter paper are given away for free, sincerely wish you can start with a cup of fragrant latte every day Bonus: 100 pieces of coffee filter paper are given away for free, sincerely wish you can start with a cup of fragrant latte every day How to use: Step 1 To start, unscrew the top part of the espresso maker with the handle from the bottom part of the espresso maker and remove the funnel that nests inside the base of the espresso maker. Step 2 Next, fill base with water (DO NOT exceed the safety valve. )Replace the funnel into the base and fill it with ground coffee; do not press coffee down. For best results, use fresh roasted, finely ground coffee. The recommendation is to use a 6-to-1 water to coffee ratio. For each tablespoon of coffee, use 3 oz. of water. Step 3 Tighten the top to the base. Make sure the top is completely screwed on to the base before putting on the stovetop. Step 4 Heat espresso maker on low to medium temperature until coffee bubbles on top. Remove from heat and serve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zfto8jcPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nobranded","source_asin":"B0895WD1C4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0895WD1C4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0895WD1C4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":818398,"name":"Tastemade Prepd Container Set Food Storage Containers - Leak-Proof, BPA-Free, Safe for Microwave, Dishwasher & Freezer Great for Meal Prep + Portion C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516tIqJqSWL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"At the core of the Prepd Pack system are the removable modular containers, which can be combined in multiple configurations within the Prepd Pack to suit your individual daily needs. With extra sets of Prepd Containers you'll have even greater flexibility and you'll be able to prepare meals for multiple days in advance. Each set includes: 1 x Large container (with Saucepot), 1 x Medium container (with Saucepot) and 2 x Small containers. Even More Flexibility - Whether you want one large main and a side or smaller meals throughout the day, the Prepd modular containers are designed to allow absolute flexibility and freedom. They are also stackable keeping your fridge neat and organised. The Perfect Container - We went back to the drawing board to create the perfect premium container, made from a new premium, BPA-free copolyester. We even redesigned the seal making them leak-proof without the need for clunky clips. No More Soggy Salads - The large and medium size containers feature a convenient saucepot that stores neatly inside the lid, keeping your dressings and other condiments separate until it’s time to eat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516tIqJqSWL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tastemade","source_asin":"B07S1M4QN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S1M4QN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S1M4QN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
