window.products.push({"id":818405,"name":"Mini Evaporative Air Cooler - Portable Cooling Air Conditioner - USB-Powered Travel, Outdoor, Desk Fan with 3 Speeds - Personal Cool Wind Machine with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61443mnQ2iS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Stay cool and refreshed anywhere you go. Are you one of those people who frequently find themselves wishing they could strap an air conditioner to themselves Trying to stay cool and dry might be challenging especially if you're dealing with hot climate or a scorching sun. To compensate, you may have tried using a portable fan. Unfortunately, all it does is blow already hot air to your face. Fortunately, our product makes it possible to enjoy cool air anywhere and everywhere you go. Delight in a cool breeze whenever you need it with the Mini Evaporative Air Cooler. A truly convenient cooling unit, our portable evaporative air conditioner uses a technology that converts water into cooled vapor in seconds. Listen to the machine hum to life as it releases a refreshingly cold breeze that can cool you down almost immediately. Despite its high-tech engineering, these cooling units are as easy to use as they are to carry. Ready in 4 simple steps, all you need to do is: 1. Uncap and add water2. Place on a flat even surface to avoid spill over from the water tank3. Plug Into USB port4. Set fan at desirable speedVoila!You've got refreshing air in seconds with very little effort.Last but not the least, we've designed our travel-sized car fans for efficiency. Each purchase comes with a USB power cord you can connect to almost anything. Use it in your car or connect it to your portable power bank! An adjustable vent allows you to point airflow exactly where it's needed. No more moving the fan to and fro to get it to face you!Here's why you'll love our portable air conditioner: Compact size design Lightweight and fits inside your luggage or car Easy to clean and maintain Purifies air for a cleaner experience Impressive cooling powerDon't let heat and sweat bother you. Add the Mini Evaporative Air Cooler to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61443mnQ2iS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B098V3NH9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098V3NH9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098V3NH9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
