window.products.push({"id":818448,"name":"skyllc® LED Digital Clock 3D Stereo Electronic Wall Clock Chinese Modern Style Glow in The Dark for Living Room Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KlAD-THxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product weight : 167g, package weight : 267gProduct Size: 21.5X3.8X8.8cm, Packing Size: 22.5X4.8X9.5cmColor: Blue lightTS-S60-W Features:?LED time display?12/24 hour format optional?Alarm clock and snooze function?Night mode setting (18:00-06:00)?Three function buttons (MODE, UP, DOWN)? USB charging cable1) Time settingIn time mode, press and hold the MODE button for 2 seconds to enter time setting mode. Setting order: hours -> minutes2) Alarm settings In the alarm mode, press and hold the MODE button for 2 seconds to enter the time setting mode. Setting order: hours -> minutes -> snoring The \"AL\" icon will flash during the setup process. 3) When alarming,a.Beep soundedb. Pressing the MODE button will stop the alarm and active snooze function. The \"AL\" icon will flash until the next alarm time is reached.c. Press the UP or DOWN button to turn off the alarm. The \"AL\" icon disappears. 4) Snooze interval setting The default snooze interval is 5 minutes. In the alarm mode, press the MODE button 3, the time will enter the snooze interval setting interface. \"05\" flicks the UP or DOWN button to set snooze time.5) Night mode functiona. Night mode means that the LED automatically reduces brightness at night.b. In the time interface, press MODE button 2 to enter the night mode interface.Day and night mode is from 18:00 to 6:00d. Press the MODE button to turn on/off the night mode function.e. When the night mode function is \"ON\", press and hold the MODE button to enter the night mode setting process. Setting order: start hour -> start minute -> stop hour -> stop minute6) brightness level settingsa. Three brightness levels: high, medium, lowb. The default is medium levelc. Press the UP button to switch between high, medium and low levels.1X LED clock1X charger1 user manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KlAD-THxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"skyllc","source_asin":"B07FKGLF6D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FKGLF6D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FKGLF6D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
