window.products.push({"id":818574,"name":"Portmeirion Sophie Conran Biscuit Mug, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Li89-tQqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Sophie Conran Collection was designed exclusively for Portmeirion. This collection is as durable and functional as it is beautiful. Sophie is part of the world-famous Conran lifestyle and culinary dynasty. The simplistic and organic nature of this collection makes it perfect for every style and taste. Each beautifully delicate item meets the hard-wearing needs of today's family and culinary experts. Available in White, Bisque and Celadon, the look can be as simple or diverse as your tastes demand. Amazon.com These simple, beautiful, and functional mugs are part of an entire tableware and bakeware collection designed by Sophie Conran, an English food writer with her own gourmet pie company. Conran infuses her namesake tableware with a flowing organic nature and tactile expression, as evidenced by the ridges and dipped rims that recall handcrafted pottery. Made of porcelain expressly for Portmeirion, the collection comes in glossy white with select pieces available in cool blue celadon and a creamy biscuit color. Each of these four mugs, with a capacity of 12-1/2 ounces, is formed as a slightly uneven cone, with a narrow base and straight sides that taper outward. A traditional ear-shaped handle adds a nice expression to these rustic yet modern mugs. Quite durable and chip-resistant, the mugs may be used to warm beverages in the microwave (or oven, if desired), and freeze iced coffee for later drinking. After use, the mugs slip into the dishwasher for easy clean-up. The set makes a great gift for those who appreciate life's simple pleasures. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Li89-tQqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Portmeirion","source_asin":"B000QDNYLI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000QDNYLI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000QDNYLI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":818575,"name":"Caspari Disposable Hand Towels, Decorative Paper Guest Towels for Bathroom or Paper Napkins Dinner Napkins, Rustic Decor Melons Pink Pak 30","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7110lDlFDRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The activities of the Royal Horticultural Society are focused on delivering a real benefit to all those involved and interested in horticulture and gardening in the UK. The RHS owns four gardens across the UK, which all hold regular talks, demonstrations and walks. Through the gardens, RHS helps gardeners across the UK by providing access to diverse plant collections, examples of innovative and attractive planting design and good horticultural practices. The RHS aims to share practical knowledge and inspire people of all ages and abilities with an interest in plants and gardening through various qualifications and school programs. They organize inspirational flower shows each year, and are the stewards of one of the finest collections of horticultural literature in the world at the RHS Lindley Library. These beautiful paper hand towels for bathroom decor are lovely fingertip towels and decorative guest towels. Disposable hand towels make clean up easy. These decorative hand towels can be used for party napkins too. Floral napkins are lovely for wedding napkins, bridal shower napkins, Mothers Day, Easter dinner napkins and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7110lDlFDRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caspari","source_asin":"B07M9CPH53","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M9CPH53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M9CPH53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
