window.products.push({"id":818867,"name":"Catalonia Sherpa Wearable Blanket Poncho for Adult Women Men, Wrap Blanket Cape with Pocket, Warm, Soft, Cozy, Snuggly, Comfort Gift, No Sleeves, Plai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fcUiC2-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester Wearable Blanket Poncho:keep you warm and comfortable in chilly night while you are camping ,enjoying outdoor concert,lounging around the house, reading a book,watching TV,on the computer,at sporting events,post game,take it anywhere you want. Not just a poncho robe but also a sherpa throw blanket. Neck opening in the middle to be used as a poncho, covers both the front and back when you wearing it. There are magnetic snaps attached on the neck opening, It can be a regular throw blanket with the hole closed. Convenient Poncho Cape,No Sleeves:helps you stay warm on cold mornings and nights while you are in the house or walking around the house.There's large front pocket to carry your phone,remote,snacks and more. One size for all,ultra soft and luxurious,smooth mirco mink fleece on one side,fluffy sherpa on the flip side.Machine Washable,wash separately in cold water,tumble dry low. Makes a great gift, perfect as holiday gifts, Mother’s Day gift, Father’s Day gift, Thanksgiving gift, Christmas gift.Gift to wife,husband,kids,parents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fcUiC2-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Catalonia","source_asin":"B07XBM6NMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XBM6NMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XBM6NMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":818868,"name":"Kate Aspen Baby Guest Book Alternative,with 30 Blank Wooden Hearts, Traditional Guest Book, Picture Frame & Display Easel - Cloud","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G+whPao4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a guest book alternative? This special Cloud Frame Baby Shower Guest Book Alternative from Kate Aspen will impress your guests and leave you with the memories of a lifetime. A shadowbox frame is in the shape of a white cloud with a charming picture of your choice inside that you and your guests will enjoy viewing. The tent card has instructions for your friends and family to leave their mark. Your friends and family members can decorate a wooden heart with their initials or a short message and place it in the shadowbox as a memory book you can take home and admire. This signature centerpiece from Kate Aspen is more meaningful than a paper memory book and can be showcased in the nursery or any room of your house to remember the fond memories of the day. The cloud design is suitable for an indoor and outdoor ceremony and is versatile to display at a wedding or baby shower. This cheery shadowbox frame with wooden hearts will get your guests right to your guestbook station to fill out a heart and make their mark on participating in your special day. Memories never fade with a special guest book alternative that makes an excellent addition to your home and your new life after your special wedding day with the love of your life. Features and Facts: - Sold in sets. Set includes 1 shadowbox frame, 1 tent card, 30 wooden hearts. - Frame: 10\" x 15\" shadowbox style frame in shape of cloud made out of wood/MDF painted white. Fits 3.5\" x 5\" photo. Tent Card: White cardstock tent card with printed black instructions. Wooden Hearts: Thin wooden heart shaped pieces for holding guest signatures. - Gift box packaging. - Frame Measures: 7.1\" w x 9.8\" d x 0.6\" h - 30 Wooden Hearts (per piece) Measure: 3.5\" w x 0.1\" d x 3.1\" h - Organza Bag Measures: 6.1\" w x 7.7\" d x 0.01\" h - Tent Card Measures: 4.9\" w x 7.1\" d x 0.1\" h - Packaged: 11.2\" w","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G+whPao4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate Aspen","source_asin":"B084V17PMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084V17PMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084V17PMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":818869,"name":"Premium Scented 4-Wick Candle, Bourbon Pecan Pie, HomeWorx by Slatkin & Co - 18 oz - Long-Lasting Jar Candle, 30-55 Hours Burn Time - Toasted Pecans, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yyPfVTttL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Long Lasting Fragrance: The Bourbon Pecan Pie 4-Wick Scented Candle from HomeWorx by Slatkin & Co. has a scent output like no other. Our candles are created with masterfully blended essential oils and optimized wicks that produce room-filling fragrance. Each 18-oz candle has a total burn time of 30-55 hours. True-To-Life Fragrances: Each of our candles tells a story with top, middle and bottom fragrance notes. Southern baking at its finest! Toasted pecans sweetened with brown sugar molasses are spiked with aged bourbon, all married together with a flaky pie crust for a warm welcome to the autumn season. Spice Up Your Décor: Every candle comes in a sturdy glass vessel topped with a metal lid embossed with Harry Slatkin’s personal monogram. The unique, photorealistic designed wraps depict Harry’s real-life inspiration of each fragrance. After the candle is finished, the glass vessel can be repurposed around your home! Safer Clean Burning Candles: Our scented candles are made with our non-toxic proprietary paraffin wax blend and safe-to-use fragrance ingredients and only use 100% cotton lead-free wicks. Our brand is cruelty-free and does not use any type of metal that contains lead. All HomeWorx candles are safe to burn around pets. What Makes HomeWorx Different: HomeWorx by Slatkin & Co. was founded by Harry Slatkin, the “king” of home fragrance, in partnership with QVC. Every fragrance is inspired by Slatkin’s real-life experiences like where he travels, what he eats, and the things he smells on a morning walk. Our candles will fill your home with the finest true-to-life fragrance experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yyPfVTttL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homeworx","source_asin":"B0BFHHN7CQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-818869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFHHN7CQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFHHN7CQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
